{"id":"5f8a5c1b6f317d3c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pp.md","title":"Probabilistic Polynomial Time","display":"df-pp — Probabilistic Polynomial Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-pp","aliases":["28-df-pp","PP"],"display":"df-pp — Probabilistic Polynomial Time","depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 17.6; printed p.345; PDF p.371","source_printed_pages":"345","source_pdf_pages":"371","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pp</span><span>PP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pp — Probabilistic Polynomial Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 17.6; printed p.345; PDF p.371"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"345"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"371"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 是随机带形式的比特输出判定机，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\">\\(M(x;r)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a> 的约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PP}\">\\(\\mathbf{PP}\\)</span> 为无固定概率间隙的多数判定语言类。采用原书包含平票的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ge1/2\">\\(\\ge1/2\\)</span> 约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]\\ge\\tfrac12\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]\\ge\\tfrac12\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义 17.6 明确采用至少一半接受证书；原稿采用严格超过一半。两种约定给出相同语言类，但机器级边界不同，此处对齐原书并明确写出。与 BPP 相比，此处没有常数概率间隙。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 是随机带形式的比特输出判定机，$M(x;r)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)$ 使用 [[28-df-bpp]] 的约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"M(x;r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ge1/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]\\ge\\tfrac12\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1377,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"概率机器与类：[[28-df-probabilistic-tm]]、[[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]、[[28-df-zpp]]、[[28-df-pp]]。"}],"outgoing":["073a1a66749fa84e"]}